sentences.text:
11. Let the applicant-Maajid Hussain @ Majid be released on bail in Case Crime No. 82 of 2023,
under Sections 323, 363, 366, 376 I.P.C., registered at Police Station Pachpedwa, District Balrampur on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
12.

